      "username": "flamethrower49",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-17T00:34:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Synaptic Interruption is not limited.  So you can have out all three at once.  What then happens if Tachyon is dealt 3 or more damage?</p>\n<p>A. One copy goes off, redirecting the damage where Tachyon pleases?<br>\nB. All copies go off, eventually redirecting the damage to only one target?<br>\nC. All copies go off, allowing Tachyon to redirect that damage three times?</p>\n<p>I’m inclined to say B.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:32.356Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
